Package: homebridge
Version: 1.7.12
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), jq, openssl, psmisc, net-tools, python3, systemd
Description: HomeKit bridge for smart home devices with web UI (Homebridge)
 Homebridge bridges hundreds of smart-home accessories that don't natively
 support HomeKit into Apple Home — and its web UI lets you manage plugins,
 pair devices and control everything from any browser at
 http://<NAS>:18246. Ships its own Node.js runtime; upstream payload is
 packaged verbatim at /opt/homebridge (start.sh hardcodes the path), with
 storage at /var/lib/homebridge.
 Upstream project: https://github.com/homebridge/homebridge (Apache-2.0),
 official build from homebridge-apt-pkg.
 .
 Native plugin compilation via the UI additionally needs make/gcc/g++/
 python3-dev (not required for the bridge itself; install manually if a
 plugin asks for it).
